<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-ICTSI Q2 NET HIGHER.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ICTSI Q2 NET HIGHER.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to June 30.</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income		    146 vs 104</p>
<p>Note: Full name International Container Terminal Services Inc. Company attributed improved performance to the increase in the volume of cargo traffic at the Manila International Container Terminal and equity earnings from port investments in Mexico and Argentina.</p>
